   "brief": "The speaker moved the Environment Protection and Biodiversity Conservation Amendment (Heritage Listing for the Bight) Bill 2018 to grant National Heritage status to the Great Australian Bight, citing 74% community support and arguing that oil drilling poses catastrophic risks, with Equinor's worst-case discharge estimates of up to 7.9 million barrels."
